                <head ana="#head_untitled-missing-head-in-printed-volume">[Untitled]</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#center">[Telegram.—<placeName>Corunna</placeName>,
                            <date calendar="gregorian" when="1865-02-12">February 12,
                        1865</date>.]</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#italic">Honorable Mr. Perry, American Chargé d’Affaires:</hi></p>
                <p>Your despatch of last night was received this morning. Yours of this morning,
                    addressed to consular agent, is before me; the agent is absent.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>CRAVEN.</signed></closer>
            </div>
